        {
          "_key": "1b64651faa75",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For many Nepali students, studying in the United States is a lifelong dream. The USA is home to world-class universities, diverse academic programs, and countless career opportunities. However, the cost of higher education can be overwhelming. The good news is that "
        },
        {
          "_key": "13da969ec6f7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "scholarships for Nepali students in the USA"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d0c0abebbb1a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " make this dream more achievable than ever. In this blog, we’ll guide you through everything you need to know about studying in the USA with scholarships from Nepal."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0f057c6acc6a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "682959c9ef4d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why Choose the USA for Higher Studies?"
