      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fddcdb7390ac",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Steps to Apply for Scholarships"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c2e01b25e5e9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4702c10c612a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Applying for scholarships may feel overwhelming, but with the right guidance it becomes manageable:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "357a656daf32",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b500b4b7c487",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Research universities and identify available scholarships."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "570ef2ce9afe",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d08755d1f405",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Prepare essential documents such as transcripts, recommendation letters, and test scores."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "28c364d2379d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bf56156200bf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Write a compelling personal statement that highlights your academic goals and financial need."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "16cf28e6146a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fb17157e8323",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Apply early, as scholarship deadlines are often months before the admission deadline."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e56c42a063e5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bed0900bac0d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Stay consistent and apply to multiple opportunities to maximize your chances."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8d0222f97682",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bbf85cfc9981",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Challenges Faced by Nepali Students"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "86745209cd87",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a39b34a08ed4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Although scholarships ease the financial burden, students may still face challenges such as adapting to a new culture, maintaining strong academic performance, and managing living expenses. With proper planning and expert guidance, these challenges can be turned into opportunities for growth."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
