      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ba5979069bac",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Studying in the USA with a scholarship from Nepal is not just a dream—it’s an achievable goal with the right approach. By choosing the right university, preparing strong applications, and seeking expert guidance, you can unlock global opportunities."
